<details>
    <summary id="link-to-me">Link to me</summary>
    <div>
        <p>If you want to link to this site, you can optionally do it with an 88x31:</p>
        <a href="{{ site.prefix }}/assets/88x31.png">
            <img
                src="{{ site.prefix }}/assets/88x31.png"
                alt="88x31 badge for this site"
            />
        </a>
        <pre><code class="language-html">&lt;a href="https://lunarwatcher.codeberg.page"&gt;
&lt;img
    src="[your URL to]/olivias-silly-blog-88x31.png"
    alt="Olivia's silly blog :3"
/&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;</code></pre>
        <p>Please avoid hotlinking the image; this site is primarily hosted on Codeberg, which has limited resources.</p>
        <p>Want me to link back? Send me an email/discord DM/open an issue on codeberg (links below) :3</p>
    </div>
</details>
